// them — the same call the commercial carpet page makes with "steam cleaning".
const definitionBody: TextBlockBody[] = [
  'Airbnb cleaning is the turnover clean between one guest checking out and the next checking in: the whole property reset, linen changed, bathrooms and kitchen done, consumables restocked and the place presented ready for arrival. TLB Cleaning does Airbnb and holiday let turnovers across the Northern Rivers, the Tweed and the Southern Gold Coast.',
  'A turnover, a changeover and a short-stay clean are the same job under three names. It is not a house clean on a shorter timeline. The difference is that it is scheduled off a booking calendar rather than a weekly slot, it has a hard deadline set by someone else, and presentation counts as much as cleanliness, because it is being photographed and reviewed by the person walking in.',
];

